oms period, they stood as the most formidable Xianbei tribe in the North, serving as the imperial forebears of the Northern Wei dynasty. Under the rule of Tuoba Liwei, they annexed the Moluhui tribe, commanding over 200,000 mounted archers. In the third year of the Ganlu era of Wei, Tuoba Liwei formally acknowledged Cao Wei as suzerain. His descendants went on to establish the state of Dai during the Sixteen Kingdoms era, which eventually evolved into the Northern Wei dynasty that unified the North."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"3","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"拓跋邻","height":"平均","shape":"精壮"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,53,73,78,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1001905","helmet":"WP1023205","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,53,73,78,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1001905","helmet":"WP1023205","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,53,73,78,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"80","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1001905","helmet":"WP1023205","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Aga